## Vintage Emerald Cut Diamond Ring Price

A vintage emerald cut diamond ring price depends entirely on two independent choices: the stone and the setting. Neither is locked to the other. A $3,140 GIA stone pairs with a $1,190 Art Deco setting just as cleanly as it pairs with a $5,015 platinum baguette.

Three natural GIA-certified emerald cut stones anchor the 1ct entry range. The spread across these stones tells you exactly what color and clarity cost at this carat weight.

